==Description==
The '''GlitterBomb Nametag''' is a nametag that can be obtained at Level 29 of the regular [[Ducky Revenge Event#Ducky Revenge Battle Pass|Ducky Revenge Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{DuckyEggs|980}} or {{Robux|88}} ({{Robux|74}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{DuckyEggs|13,490}} or {{Robux|2,240}} ({{Robux|1,890}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale).

The '''GlitterBomb Nametag''' has pink text with a dark pink outline. It has a pink smoke behind the text, accompanied by multiple small sparkles and pink circles.

